    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate veterinary staff and technicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most reviewers speak warmly of Dr Youssef, Dr Pittman, and veterinary technician Deidra, praising their kindness and dedicated bedside manner. Pet owners highlight that staff members treat animals like family and explain medical care attentively. A minority of reviewers expressed frustration with front desk reception or felt unassisted during midday desk visits."
      },
      "mentions": 40,
      "sentiment": "positive"
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "title": {
        "en": "Complex surgeries and medical treatments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report successful surgical interventions and diagnostic findings, including foreign body removal, Caesarean deliveries, and senior pet care. While many praise the clinical outcomes, several reviewers raised critical concerns regarding diagnostic interpretations and treatment efficacy for chronic ailments."
      },
      "mentions": 11,
      "sentiment": "mixed"
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "title": {
        "en": "Treatment pricing and clinical estimates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Client impressions of fees are divided. While several pet parents consider the fees reasonable for routine checkups and travel certifications, others voiced strong dissatisfaction regarding physical examination charges, wellness package markups, and unexpected procedure costs."
      },
      "mentions": 7,
      "sentiment": "negative"
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does North Star Animal Hospital assist with pet international travel certificates?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers report successful consultations and paperwork completion for international and military relocations."
      },
